---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Action from '../components/Action.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import { breadcrumbNode } from '../lib/schema';
import examples from '../data/room-studio-previews.json';
import studioPage from '../room-studio/page.json';
const crumbs=[{name:'Home',href:'/'},{name:'Wallpaper my room',href:'/room-studio/'}];
---
<Base title="Wallpaper my room | Mr Wallcover" description="Original measured-room wallpaper studies, and the Mr Wallcover Atelier for a wallpaper on a photo of your own wall, while the 3D editor completes testing." path="/room-studio/" image="/media/room-studio/examples/willow-chimney-1.webp" imageAlt="Original illustrative wallpaper study around a chimney breast" imageCredit="Original Room Studio illustration" extraSchema={[breadcrumbNode(crumbs)]} updated={studioPage.updated}>
  <div class="container-page studio-introduction">
    <Breadcrumb items={crumbs}/>
    <header><p class="eyebrow">Mr Wallcover / Room Studio</p><h1>Wallpaper<br/><em>my room.</em></h1><p class="lede">See how a wallpaper pattern sits around corners, windows and a chimney breast.</p><p>The photo preview is open: <a href="/atelier/">Mr Wallcover Atelier</a> lays a wallpaper on a photograph of your wall at true scale. The measured 3D editor is still completing testing and is not yet available on this page. Explore three original rendered studies below, or talk to us about your room and chosen finish.</p><Action href="/atelier/" variant="primary">Open the Atelier</Action> <Action href="/contact/" variant="quiet">Discuss your room</Action></header>
    <section aria-labelledby="example-heading"><h2 id="example-heading">Three rooms.<br/><em>Three considered finishes.</em></h2><p>These are original architectural illustrations rendered from measured room geometry. They are not manufacturer wallpapers, photographs of customers’ rooms or completed commissions.</p><div class="studio-introduction-grid">{examples.map(example=><article><a href={`/media/room-studio/examples/${example.id}-1.webp`} aria-label={`Open full-size ${example.name} room study`}><img src={`/media/room-studio/examples/${example.id}-preview.webp`} width="960" height="540" alt={`Original illustrative ${example.name} wallpaper study: ${example.layout.toLowerCase()}`} loading="lazy"/></a><div><p class="eyebrow">{example.layout}</p><h3>{example.name}</h3><p>{example.description}</p><a href={`/media/room-studio/examples/${example.id}-1.webp`}>View 1920 × 1080 room study</a></div></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="studio-introduction-next"><h2>A room to make your own.</h2><p>The <a href="/atelier/">Mr Wallcover Atelier</a> already lays wallpaper or paint on a photograph of your wall at true scale; the planned studio adds a measured 3D layout and Bauwerk limewash. Free previews and an optional finished-render package are being prepared. Automatic plan reading and live payments remain disabled while the service is verified.</p><p>Colour, texture and light on screen are illustrative. Always check a physical sample in your room.</p><Action href="/materials/" variant="secondary">Explore wallcovering materials</Action> <Action href="/calculator/" variant="quiet">Wallpaper calculator</Action></section>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>
.studio-introduction{padding-top:48px;padding-bottom:64px}.studio-introduction header{max-width:58rem;margin-bottom:56px}.studio-introduction h1{font-size:clamp(64px,7vw,104px);line-height:.95;margin:24px 0}.studio-introduction h1 em,.studio-introduction h2 em{color:#6d7755;font-weight:400}.studio-introduction .lede{font-size:21px;max-width:45ch}.studio-introduction p{max-width:70ch}.studio-introduction-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px;margin:28px 0}.studio-introduction article{border:1px solid #d6d8ca;background:#fffdf7}.studio-introduction article img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover}.studio-introduction article>div{padding:22px}.studio-introduction article .eyebrow{font-size:15px}.studio-introduction article a{display:inline-flex;min-height:44px;align-items:center}.studio-introduction article>a{display:block}.studio-introduction-next{border-top:1px solid #c8cdbf;padding-top:32px;margin-top:48px}@media(max-width:900px){.studio-introduction-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.studio-introduction{padding-top:32px}.studio-introduction h1{font-size:64px}}
</style>
